<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45714" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭārĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		sus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			swine</i>, <i>swine-.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">negotiator,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					21, 3, 7, § 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">forum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					1, 12, 1</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Substt.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭārĭus</span></b> ,
			ii, m.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>A swine-herd</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 51,
				77, § 208</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>A swine-dealer</i>, Cod. Th. 14, 4, 3; <i><span class="en">Symm.
				Ep. 10, 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell.
			3672</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭārĭa</span></b> , ae,
				f., <i>traffic in swine</i>, Edict. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut. 647, 7</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
